People want the magic demo. Agent talks. Screen sparkles. Room claps.

Then Monday hits and the lead still sits in an inbox for three days.

Algility wins when the boring path is automatic. Intake. Route. Follow-up. Handoff. Log. Repeat. No hero required.

Flash gets attention. Reliability gets retained.

If a system needs you in the loop every time, you didn't build leverage. You built a job with extra steps.
